T*
(mode rendering. <html> root wraps <head> \(metadata, title, character encoding UTF-8,) Tj
T*
(responsive viewport\) and <body> \(renderable visual elements\).) Tj
T*
(* The DOM Tree: The hierarchical tree structure generated by the browser rendering) Tj
T*
(engine parsing HTML markup. Every tag becomes an Element Node; text inside tags) Tj
T*
(becomes a Text Node; attributes become Attribute Nodes.) Tj
T*
